## sdk 2.0.0 (2026-09-02)

### Fixes

- **Validate deployment credentials before building.** The deployment job rejects missing or malformed SSH keys before building an application image. Operators can correct the production environment credentials without waiting for a build to finish.
  _Owner:_ test · _Introduced in:_ [COMMIT]
